            <history xml:id="history_434N201B1">
               <p xml:id="idm119">Magdalene Thoresen's story "Solen i Siljedalen" was twenty-four years old when Hartmann decided to set music to the nine songs.They are sung by four different persons, but as the songs are written in the same range they can be performed as a cycle by the same singer.</p>
            </history>
